    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're prepped and ready for any zombie horde. . . but survival is never that simple</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone B Korosu is a story-rich zombie adventure with a mix of side-scrolling combat,  top-down exploration,\u00a0interactive narrative scenes, and some classic SNES-style flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a city mid-apocalypse and face weighted choices. Will you stand your ground against waves of the infected\u2014or run for your life? Become the hero Bridge City needs? Or keep your head down and focus on your own path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix of fast-paced action sequences and down-tempo chillzones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro-inspired pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World of NPCs to interact with...or not!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-energy soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Digestible playtime (2-4 hrs)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone B Korosu is a living project. We're a small and passionate team, constantly working to improve your experience. Expect updates, refinements, and new content as the world, story,\u00a0 and our team grow.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're prepped and ready for any zombie horde. . . but survival is never that simple</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone B Korosu is a story-rich zombie adventure with a mix of side-scrolling combat,  top-down exploration,\u00a0interactive narrative scenes, and some classic SNES-style flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a city mid-apocalypse and face weighted choices. Will you stand your ground against waves of the infected\u2014or run for your life? Become the hero Bridge City needs? Or keep your head down and focus on your own path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix of fast-paced action sequences and down-tempo chillzones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro-inspired pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World of NPCs to interact with...or not!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-energy soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Digestible playtime (2-4 hrs)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zone B Korosu is a living project. We're a small and passionate team, constantly working to improve your experience. Expect updates, refinements, and new content as the world, story,\u00a0 and our team grow.</p>",
